    ("Grapefruit", "Citrus paradisi", "fruit", "Regulate qi", "cool", "Sweet, Sour, Bitter", "Lung, Stomach", ["Phlegm", "Digestive support", "Thirst", "Food stagnation"], "Grapefruit is cooling, sour-bitter-sweet, and useful as a food comparison for phlegm, thirst, and rich-food stagnation.", "Grapefruit interacts with many medicines. Use caution with prescriptions, reflux, or citrus allergy.", "greenhouse", "Grapefruit is a protected pot or greenhouse citrus in the UK, not an outdoor crop.", "A bitter-sour citrus for food stagnation and phlegm comparisons.", "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Grapefruit.jpg"),
